Failure           Detection -> Mitigation -> Evaluation (chapters)
wrong_tool        eval: expected tool not called
                  -> better tool names, descriptions -> routing eval (Ch 3, 27)
wrong_args        eval: tool called with wrong args
                  -> schemas, enums, examples -> argument checks (Ch 3, 27)
tool_failure      tool span error flag
                  -> retries, fallbacks, clear errors -> fault injection (Ch 7, 19)
misread_result    right tools, no errors, wrong answer
                  -> structured results -> answer vs data check (Ch 8, 27)
hallucination     answer numbers in no tool result
                  -> cite sources, verify -> groundedness check (Ch 6, 18, 27)
context_overflow  stop: context window exceeded
                  -> trim, summarize, retrieve -> long-input cases (Ch 16)
injection         guard blocked a tool result
                  -> quarantine untrusted text -> red-team suite (Ch 14, 25)
planning_failure  trajectory eval: bad plan
                  -> plan, then check the plan -> trajectory eval (Ch 20)
infinite_loop     same call repeated / step limit
                  -> loop detector, step cap -> step-limit test (Ch 4, 28)
auth_failure      tool error.type not_authorized
                  -> scoped tokens, checks -> permission tests (Ch 26)
runaway           cost, time or steps over budget
                  -> budgets, cheaper models -> budget assertions (Ch 29)
